CLASS:: KSPayload
summary:: A decoded, validated Score.write file
categories:: Scheduling
related:: Classes/EventScheduler

DESCRIPTION::
Reads code::{"meta": {...}, "events": [...]}:: as Klotho's code::Score.write:: writes it and recovers the types by schema (code::String:parseJSON:: returns every scalar as a String): ids, group names, def names and speaker labels stay strings; starts, durations and pfield values become numbers; null stays nil. Reads the companion code::<stem>.wav:: control buffer and infers code::blockSize:: when code::meta.blockSize:: is absent. Every structural refusal throws an Error before the player has sent anything.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: read
ARGUMENT:: path
Path to the JSON file.

METHOD:: resolveDefName
The browser's rule: code::__rest__:: stays, nil or code::sonic-pi-beep:: becomes code::kl_tri::.

METHOD:: companionWavPath
code::Path(filepath).with_suffix('.wav')::.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: events
Playable events (new, set, release) as Events with keys code::type, id, start, defName, dur, releaseAfter, pfields, group, speaker, speakerLane::. Read code::group:: with code::ev[\group]:: (code::Event:group:: is a method).

METHOD:: groups
METHOD:: inserts
METHOD:: spatial
METHOD:: descriptors
The decoded code::meta:: sections.

METHOD:: blockSize
METHOD:: blockSizeSource
METHOD:: controlFloats
METHOD:: numFrames
The control-envelope buffer.

METHOD:: pieceDur
code::max(start + dur):: over new and set events with a duration.

METHOD:: isBare
True when code::meta:: has none of code::groups::, code::inserts::, code::spatial::: the single-group path with code::out:: taken from the pfields.

METHOD:: instrumentDefNames
METHOD:: sampleNames
METHOD:: notes
What the file asks for, and soft problems found while reading it.
